cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TSSC — Foundational Experiments"
message: "If you use this software or the theory, please cite the paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cosci
    given-names: Filippo
repository-code: "https://github.com/tssc-ai"
abstract: >
  Reference implementation of the five foundational numerical experiments for
  the Theory of the Continuous Semantic Space (TSSC): the epsilon* closed-form
  identity, its selectivity, the hub-hijacking demonstration of receiver
  normalization, the L-infinity contraction bound, and weighted rank-1 ALS with
  the disjoint-support guarantee.
keywords:
  - semantic space
  - field theory of meaning
  - non-negative matrix factorization
  - contraction dynamics
license: MIT
